					<div  class="alert" data-label="by-order-of-sheriff-darren-weekly-stage-1-fire-restrictions-are-in-place-for-unincorporated-areas-of-douglas-county-as-of-aug-20-2026">

						<span class="alert-label">Alert</span>

						<div class="content"><p>By order of Sheriff Darren Weekly, <strong><a class="ql-link" href="https://www.douglasco.gov/stage-1-fire-restrictions-in-place-effective-aug-20-2026/" rel="noopener noreferrer" data-test="link-preview-plain">Stage 1 Fire Restrictions</a> </strong>are in place for unincorporated areas of Douglas County as of Aug. 20, 2026.</p>
</div>

