<section class="image-callout bg-grey side-left" >
    
    <div  class="container">

            
        <div  class="image cover " style="background-image: url('https://www.douglasco.gov/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/Fire-on-mountainside_NR-1-of-1.jpg')">
    
                
        </div>

        
        <div  class="sub-content">
        
            <h2>Protect your life, family and property during National Preparedness Month</h2>

            <div class="content"><p><span data-contrast="none">What would you do if you had to leave your home immediately because of a wildfire or flood? Are you prepared to safely endure severe weather at home or in your vehicle?</span><span data-ccp-props="{&quot;134233117&quot;:true,&quot;134233118&quot;:true,&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559740&quot;:240}"> </span></p>
<p><span data-contrast="none">During<strong> National Preparedness Month</strong> this September, Douglas County encourages everyone to take simple steps now to prepare for an emergency.</span><span data-ccp-props="{&quot;134233117&quot;:true,&quot;134233118&quot;:true,&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559740&quot;:240}"> </span></p>
</div>

                            
                <a href='https://www.douglasco.gov/protect-your-life-family-and-property-during-national-preparedness-month/'  class="button ">Learn more about how you can prepare</a>
                
            
        </div>
        
    </div>

</section><section class="cta"  >

	<div  class="container">

		<div  class="cta-content">

            
